# Sukhwal Auto Services SMTP Email Configuration
# If you are using Gmail, SMTP_HOST should be smtp.gmail.com and SMTP_PORT should be 587.
# For Gmail, SMTP_PASSWORD must be a 16-character Google App Password (not your normal password).
# How to get an App Password: Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification -> App passwords.

SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASSWORD=
SMTP_FROM=
